":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"导师笔记：配给站\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\" 配给站由共和国运营，所有商品均按固定价格出售，不受市场影响。\\n\\n然而虽然价格固定，商品供应却仍然很容易受到市场影响。\\n在配给站只能使用食品券购买商品。\\n\\n<u>关店后可前往配给站购买商品。<\/u>\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"——导师\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false}]},{\"identifier\":\"tutorial_page\",\"unitCount\":1,\"uuid\":43,\"itemShape\":{\"<minX>k__BackingField\":0,\"<minY>k__BackingField\":0,\"<flipped>k__BackingField\":false,\"<orientation>k__BackingField\":0,\"<width>k__BackingField\":2,\"<height>k__BackingField\":2,\"data\":[1,1,1,1],\"outside\":0},\"itemModifiedShape\":{\"<minX>k__BackingField\":6,\"<minY>k__BackingField\":4,\"<flipped>k__BackingField\":false,\"<orientation>k__BackingField\":0,\"<width>k__BackingField\":2,\"<height>k__BackingField\":2,\"data\":[1,1,1,1],\"outside\":0},\"itemType\":\"GameItemElement\",\"name\":\"导师笔记：物品标签\",\"shortDescription\":\"\",\"flavorText\":\"\",\"uniqueId\":36,\"unitBaseValue\":0,\"unitValue\":0,\"lateUnitValue\":0,\"backupUnitValue\":0,\"spriteAtlasPath\":\"Items\/itematlas\",\"spritePath\":\"tutorial_page\",\"itemTypes\":[\"DOCUMENT\"],\"childItems\":[],\"childItemInventoryNode\":[],\"_keys\":[\"DOCUMENT\",\"IMPORTANT_TAG\",\"TUTORIAL_PAPER_TAG\",\"IS_OWNED_TAG\",\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\"],\"_values\":[{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"DOCUMENT\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_DOCUMENT\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"IMPORTANT_TAG\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_IMPORTANT_TAG\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAPER_TAG\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAPER_TAG\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"IS_OWNED_TAG\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_IS_OWNED_TAG\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_TITLE\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"导师笔记：物品标签\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_BODY\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\" 部分物品可以更换标签。例如，你可以给一盒假冒香烟贴上正品标签，以此抬高售价。\\n\\n但要当心——大多数工人、治安部警官和下层区公民都对常见的造假手段了如指掌。诈骗企图将会失败，还会导致你的声望下降。\\n拾荒者虽然也熟悉物品造假，但他们通常不会随身携带鉴别真假的设备——如果需要用到设备的话。\\n相比之下，游客和上层区公民一般对此更加欠缺防备。\\n不过，纸包不住火，人们迟早会发现端倪的。\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false},{\"<identifier>k__BackingField\":\"TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\",\"<identifierName>k__BackingField\":\"TYPE-STRING_TUTORIAL_PAGE_SIGNATURE\",\"valueEnabled\":true,\"internalValueString\":\"——导师\",\"valueInt\":0,\"valueFloat\":0.0,\"valueLong\":0,\"valueDouble\":0.0,\"valueBool\":false}]},{\"identifier\":\"tutoria